Okay, so let's talk about exercise.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.970
There is a fascinating link
between your psychology

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.210
and your physiology.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.270
It seems like what's good for the body

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.910
is also good for the mind.

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:32.930
It's the reason why power
posing somehow, you know

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.320
like you're like standing up

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:36.150
and putting your hands
on your hips or whatever,

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.830
that kind of stuff increases testosterone.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.400
It's bizarre to think of it,

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.770
but literally just power
posing, feeling powerful

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.740
lowers your cortisol, which
is your stress hormone

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.940
and increases your testosterone

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.030
making you feel more
confident and powerful.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.510
And you hear so many accounts of people

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.320
who fix their posture

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.470
which allowed them to go about
the day with more confidence.

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.350
It's like a chicken or the egg thing.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.330
They fixed their physiology

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.920
which translated into
benefits for their psychology.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.330
The only reason why I'm saying this

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.780
is because one of the most effective ways

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.900
that you can have more
energy throughout the day

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.580
is to move your body.

