00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.160
- So you might be thinking,
Joey, you're an active guy.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.810
You go to the gym, you play hockey.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.410
So that probably wasn't that
big of a problem for you.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.820
Well, it turns out it was.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:56.140
I play hockey once or
twice a in the evenings.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.070
And then I go to the gym for
like half an hour to 45 minutes

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.780
to do some heavy lifting

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.330
three to four times a week.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.870
But I spend the rest of
that time by and large

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.470
sitting on my butt, editing videos,

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.130
writing content, whatever.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:12.610
This sedentary lifestyle
was draining my energy.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.990
So I made a simple tweak.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.640
Not only do I make sure
I get out and take a walk

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:19.500
