bought a standing desk.

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:25.160
So I spend a large portion of my time

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.820
when I'm being productive,
standing up on my desk

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.300
rather than sitting down.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:31.570
And this has that power posing effect.

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:34.370
The fact that I'm standing
up my body kind of learns

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:37.500
that I'm more active and
I'm somebody who stands up.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.270
So it's like here have more energy.

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:42.310
So use this weird phenomenon
to your advantage.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:45.680
Make sure that every single
day you're getting up,

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.670
out of your chair you're going for a walk.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.310
You know, a minute, every hour,

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.120
three to five minutes every hour.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:54.070
If you're wanna be ambitious,
get up from your chair,

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.890
go for a walk, go do something.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:58.683
The energy benefits will come in droves.

